@startuml SD02
title SD02 – Quen mat khau (OTP)

actor "Nguoi dung" as U
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend" as BE
participant "Email" as MAIL
database "Database" as DB

U -> FE : Nhap email
FE -> BE : POST /api/password/send-reset-code
BE -> DB : Luu ma OTP (het han 15 phut)
BE -> MAIL : Gui Email chua ma OTP
MAIL --> U : Nhan ma OTP

U -> FE : Nhap ma OTP
FE -> BE : POST /api/password/verify-reset-code
BE -> DB : Kiem tra ma OTP hop le
BE --> FE : Ma hop le

U -> FE : Nhap mat khau moi
FE -> BE : POST /api/password/reset-password
BE -> DB : Cap nhat mat khau moi + danh dau OTP da dung
BE --> FE : 200 Thanh cong
FE --> U : Chuyen den trang Dang nhap
@enduml
